WEBVTT

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.230
We're breaking up, Chunta.

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:10.150
That hurts. Brute strength.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.490
If that's a joke, it isn't funny.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.780
Takato, what the hell are you hiding from me?

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:19.620
I'm just breaking up.
There's nothing behind it.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.450
Liar.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.750
I'm not lying.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:29.130
Do you really want to break up with me?

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:31.130
Yeah.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:34.470
Sheesh.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:36.260
You and those wild animal eyes.

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.970
This is the end.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:43.430
If you're that in love with me, you can
have your way with me until you're done.

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:18.150
hug 11 "If you're that in love with me, you can
have your way with me until you're done."

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:22.620
You brought me to a fleabag hotel?

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.910
I chose an unpopular hotel in the suburbs.

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:28.660
Perfect for a night like tonight, isn't it?

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:32.710
Or would you prefer a fancy hotel
with a scenic night view?

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.670
This will do. Let's get it over with.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.880
Then take off your clothes, everything.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:47.770
The last time I had you do it
was when I had a cold.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:53.980
Not yet, Takato?

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:57.150
Let me have my fill of you.

00:02:57.360 --> 00:02:59.950
You're shivering. Are you okay?

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.820
Shut up! Don't say anything.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.830
I'd like to keep my mouth shut,

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:08.790
but at this rate, the sun will come up
before I'm satisfied.

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:14.840
Will you be able to forget me?

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:17.460
Keep quiet.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:19.130
Don't be so conceited.

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:23.090
In the morning,
I'll forget everything. Everything.

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:25.390
Big talk.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.690
The sky's turning gray.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.770
You can let me out here.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.110
I'll drop you off at your apartment.

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.230
Otherwise you'd probably limp home.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.530
Never mind. Let me out.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:45.990
See you, Azumaya.

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.630
JIRO HASEGAWA

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.420
Yeah, that's right.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:01.260
Regarding what we talked about, I'll accept it.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:04.050
Right, a trade for the data.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.560
Bye, Chunta.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:12.310
THE WEEKLY TOBUN

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:12.310
THE WEEKLY ASASHIO

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.310
Did you see on the internet about Takato?

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:14.440
The "Tobun," right? Is it true?

00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:19.230
They're hugging in the picture,
and Takato looks so serious.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:20.400
Who's the other guy?

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:23.650
I really liked him. This is a shock!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:23.990
SUPER IN LOVE?

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:29.120
Oh, no! It's spreading
all over the social networks, too!

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.120
Naturally.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.120
THE WEEKLY TOBUN

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.830
Nitto Talent may be able to make
a backroom deal with the industry,

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:37.630
but they can't keep people from talking.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:42.760
Jeez. Whatever the truth is, anyone who would
put a spoke in the wheel of someone's romance

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:45.430
deserves to be kicked in the head by a horse.

00:04:45.430 --> 00:04:50.640
Oh, my, after the hostility you've shown
for Takato, now you're sticking up for him?

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:54.230
I'm not sticking up for him.
But I appreciate him.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:59.520
That boy definitely changed
ever since he co-starred with Takato.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:04.820
Poor Azumaya. He's been like this all day.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:09.450
I'm worried we won't get
our usual indifferent kid back.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.740
Then it's true. Those two—

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:13.120
Ouch!

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:17.170
I have no intention of letting Jun
get married while I'm still breathing!

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:21.300
And if you spread the word that Jun's the one
in that photo, I'll have your head on a platter!

00:05:21.300 --> 00:05:23.300
I won't say anything.

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:24.470
But still...

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:27.930
you can tell by Takato's face
in this picture that he's aroused.

00:05:27.930 --> 00:05:29.090
I wonder if he took it.

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.180
He?

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:36.020
There are quiet rumors in the biz
about an oddly talented photographer.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:38.690
His ability is wasted working for gossip rags.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:43.570
Jurio, could you
look into that photographer for me?

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.280
Please, Jurio.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.280
O-Of course!
I'll investigate him right away!

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.540
H-Hey, you!

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:56.290
Don't touch my Jun with your dirty face!

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:57.750
My face isn't dirty!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.670
A normal person would say,
"Dirty hands"! Hands!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.210
In your case, your face is dirty!

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.550
- Our faces are similar, bro!
- Your face looks like a hand!

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.220
My face does not look like a hand!

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:10.510
Are you saying that's the culprit's motive?

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:12.010
I don't get it.

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:17.730
You cops don't get it,
because you don't truly love people.

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:19.480
Okay, that'll do it!

00:06:19.480 --> 00:06:21.980
You gave me a great shot, Saijo!

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:23.480
Thank you.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:26.490
Nice work, Mr. Saijo.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.780
I've been a fan of this drama
since the previous season.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:33.200
You're really charming as the criminal.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:35.910
Really? It's nice to hear that.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.830
Mr. Saijo isn't acting any differently.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:40.790
He's got a strong will.

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.130
Even though that article just came out.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:45.250
I guess you have to be
shameless in this ind—

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.090
Shut up!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:49.930
W-Work, work!

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:51.800
M-Me too!

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:57.140
<i>I'm not so weak
that a little stress throws me off.</i>

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:58.680
<i>Don't make light of me.</i>

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:06.360
Every time I look at this doll,
I think of how creepy it is.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.780
<i>It's to commemorate our first beach date!</i>

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.910
For crying out loud.
He foisted this weird thing on me.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:16.490
Really troublesome.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:17.620
Good job!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.540
M-Mr. Sakamaki!

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:25.380
Awesome, totally awesome!
Brilliant scene, as expected, Saijo!

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:27.880
Thanks.

00:07:28.210 --> 00:07:30.170
Oh, yeah, about that article!

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:31.510
What bad luck!

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:35.220
I swear, the "Tobun,"
what a bunch of vultures!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:39.520
Of course, I don't believe it!

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:42.310
You can't let some weekly magazine
get you down!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:43.270
Right.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.940
Brush it off! Cheer up!

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:50.740
Who brought this creepy doll thing in here?

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:54.700
Hey, everybody, listen up!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:58.830
Who owns this cursed doll thing?
I'm going to throw it away!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:00.870
<i>We match!</i>

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:02.580
It's...

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:03.580
It's mine.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.500
Usaka? What are you doing here?

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:10.260
Observing. I was in the neighborhood.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:14.510
Can I have that back, Producer Sakamaki?

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.300
H-Here you go...

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.430
Executive Producer Usaka.

00:08:18.430 --> 00:08:19.680
It's a lovely doll!

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.770
Hm? There's a crack.

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:28.570
W-Well, I've got an important meeting today,
so I'd better get back!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.820
Mr. Usaka.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.280
Um, that's...

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:37.200
What? You want it?

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.030
No.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:39.950
If you want it, I'll give it to you.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.870
Thank you.

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:49.300
Why don't you and I have a talk, Takato?

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.420
Hey, Boss? It's Taguchi.

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.380
Yeah, yeah. No, no.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:59.220
You don't have to worry about Azumaya at all.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.310
Just the opposite.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:05.190
What are you thinking?

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:08.020
Do you intend to come to hell with me?

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:11.570
I'm the only one who's going to hell, Kayo.

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:16.490
I would be willing to do anything
to get a smile from you.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.700
Stop it!

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:23.410
Okay, okay! We got it!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:27.710
He keeps getting better and better.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:32.130
Azumaya, what happened to you?

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:35.340
I'm in awe.
You had me on the edge of my seat.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.090
Oh, more than me?

00:09:38.760 --> 00:09:40.100
Yurie!

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:41.600
What are you talking about?

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:44.930
Yurie Kurokawa always has me
on the edge of my seat!

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:49.610
That's okay. I hate to say it,
but you totally stole that scene.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:54.110
Oh, no. I'm just desperately trying
to keep up with you, Ms. Kurokawa.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.950
Desperately, huh?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:00.200
Thank you for the cute lip service
with an innocent face.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.530
It's true.

00:10:01.870 --> 00:10:06.580
I wish you would give me more guidance,
Ms. Kurokawa.

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.620
If it wouldn't be a hassle.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.800
Azumaya?

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:14.590
<i>What?! What happened to Jun?!</i>

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.590
<i>Tagu! Tagu! Hey, Taguchi!</i>

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:29.650
Where am I?

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:32.060
On the floor of my house, you souse.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:33.610
Mr. Usaka?!

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:38.240
Then this curiously messy room is yours?

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:43.160
I see. Then you don't remember?

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.740
You don't remember coming over,
slugging down drinks,

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:48.370
getting drunk,
getting worked up, throwing up,

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.460
acting extremely odd,
and laying waste to my living room?

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:57.590
Sheesh. I figured you would break down
and sob. I'm glad you're fine.

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:02.340
Yep, I'm fine. My tears don't come cheap.

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:04.260
So not cute.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:10.020
I really am sorry about all this.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:14.320
You should be.
I still have spots to fill for the movie.

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:18.440
And the "Tobun" being the "Tobun," there's
no guarantee they don't have a second salvo.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:24.830
If a definitive story comes out about my lead,
the whole movie will be canceled.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.580
You don't have to worry about that.

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:29.960
How can you be so sure?

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.250
Don't shut up now.

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:35.630
If you think you caused me problems,
at least tell me about it.

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.420
I made a deal.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.220
With the "Tobun"?

00:11:41.220 --> 00:11:42.890
Directly with the photographer...

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:46.260
so he wouldn't release
any other photos with him in them.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:47.600
And in exchange?

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:51.230
I have to let him take a "good photo" of me.

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:52.980
Are you an idiot?

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:55.770
It doesn't matter to me.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:12:00.570
I may not be cast again
for a lead or major role,

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:05.370
but I'm clever and talented enough
to get work somewhere.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:09.160
You don't know
what he's going to demand of you.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.370
Probably something
where I have to get naked.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:14.790
So I'll strip.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.540
You're naive.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.380
Mr. Usaka?

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:24.260
Brat. Don't you think
this is what he wants from you?

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:26.930
No! Hey!

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:30.720
I'm a man. I don't...

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:36.650
A man? Didn't Junta Azumaya
seek out this man to do things like this?

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:39.440
Listen, Takato.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:43.030
What would you do
if I said I could go for you, too?

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:44.530
Mr. Usaka.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:48.030
I'll test your resolve.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.500
<i>What is this?</i>

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.620
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:56.380
Takato.

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.420
<i>Takato.</i>

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:01.260
<i>It's completely different
from being touched by him.</i>

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:04.590
<i>Damn it! I have resolve in spades!</i>

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:06.720
Mr. Usaka.

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:12.060
Forget it. If you're trembling like a leaf,
I'm not interested.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:17.940
Maybe you're the one
who lacks resolve, Mr. Usaka.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:22.360
If you really want to test me,
you should do it on your bed, not the floor.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:24.990
You want to protect him that badly?

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:28.570
In this business, his talent is a treasure.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:31.370
You would sacrifice your career?

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:33.450
Yes.

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.830
Are your 20 years that cheap?

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:40.540
They are cheap, compared to his talent.

00:13:44.510 --> 00:13:47.590
Mr. Usaka, thank you for the advice.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:51.720
I'm suddenly exhausted.

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.850
I thought you were smarter than this.

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:58.190
Huh? I thought you were
going to test my resolve.

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:03.980
As if I could have sex with someone
I've been watching since middle school.

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.660
Last week's magazine sold like hotcakes!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.120
You're amazing, Hase!

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:12.620
Let me treat you to sushi!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:14.580
Nah, I'm on a diet.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:17.500
Oh, come on. Is that a poke at me?

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:23.090
Hase, I have a feeling
you're holding on to something even juicier.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:25.300
You overestimate me.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.680
It isn't overestimation.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:32.470
Hase, I have a feeling you haven't been
completely tainted by this business yet.

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:35.560
I suspect you still have a dream.

00:14:36.020 --> 00:14:39.140
A dream? I'm a first-class hyena.

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:41.690
I'm focused on making a living.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.360
Well, whatever.

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:48.400
Bring me more stuff, Hase.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:57.960
AUDITION FOR A DRAMA

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:55.120
<i>I got an audition for an upcoming drama!</i>

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:57.960
<i>Mr. Hasegawa,
make me look cute for my headshot.</i>

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.710
<i>You have talent, Hasegawa.</i>

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.840
<i>I hear you want to be a photographer?</i>

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:07.510
MAJOR ACTOR K CHEATING
WITH 19-YEAR-OLD IDOL

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:07.510
<i>I'll help you out however I can,
so in exchange, could you get me a shot?</i>

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:10.550
IDOL M DUMPED FROM GROUP FOR
HAVING AN AFFAIR WITH A MARRIED MAN

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:10.550
<i>You need to work your way up the food chain.</i>

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:16.390
How could I have a dream
after making a living off of people's misery?

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:22.100
It's you.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:25.690
Hello, Jiro Hasegawa.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:29.450
I guess you have another incriminating photo?

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:30.990
You have a good nose.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:34.030
Or did you hear it from Takato Saijo?

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:35.660
He didn't tell me anything.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.210
It's a good shot.

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:43.710
Why is someone as talented as you
doing this kind of work?

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.250
<i>You're wasting your talent.</i>

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:48.210
<i>You're too good for the tabloids.</i>

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:52.340
You're saying more or less the same thing.

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.720
So what do you want?

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:58.310
I want you to destroy all traces of this photo.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.520
Yeah, I figured.

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:06.770
Yes. The day this photo hits the newsstands,
my current partner is likely to get jealous.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:11.280
After seeing a photo of me and my ex, you know?

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:15.120
So that rumor is true?

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:17.370
That's right.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.750
This photo is already past its expiration date.

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:23.290
If you want to take
an even more interesting photo,

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:24.460
come and see me anytime.

00:16:24.830 --> 00:16:27.420
I'll provide you with an up-to-date topic.

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:35.180
Yurie Kurokawa gives a matching ring
to the man she gets along well with.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:40.020
And Takato Saijo
was trying to protect a man like that.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:45.520
<i>I haven't heard back from that photographer.</i>

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.480
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:16:49.150 --> 00:16:52.280
Hello. Do you have a few minutes?

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.870
If you're seen with me, you'll be in trouble.

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:59.080
You went to the trouble of buying a "Tobun"?

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.250
It's funny when I imagine it.

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:04.620
Go ahead and laugh if you like.

00:17:04.620 --> 00:17:07.000
SCOOP

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.000
This is him, isn't it?

00:17:10.050 --> 00:17:11.760
You don't trust me, huh?

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:13.130
I won't tell anyone.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:16.930
I'm just concerned about you
as a colleague whom I respect.

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:19.310
That's not like you.

00:17:19.310 --> 00:17:20.430
That's mean.

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:22.390
You don't have to worry about me.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:25.310
Nobody will take any more photos like that.

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:26.850
What does that mean?

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:31.320
Aside from work, Azumaya and I
aren't going to see each other again.

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:34.990
Then...

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.580
Are you sure that's what you want?

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:45.210
Jeez. This is no time for you
to be fussing over somebody else.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.460
After our play, weren't you flooded with offers?

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:53.630
Well, yes, thanks to you.

00:17:53.630 --> 00:17:55.590
But that's neither here nor there.

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.470
It's about you, Mr. Saijo.

00:17:57.970 --> 00:17:59.300
What?!

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.140
You need to work hard now.

00:18:01.140 --> 00:18:02.970
Focus on your work.

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.930
You have no reason to obsess over crap.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:06.980
Crap?

00:18:08.560 --> 00:18:11.190
You refuse to complain, huh?

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:14.070
Even though I'm ready to console you.

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:19.240
I haven't fallen so far
that I need to be consoled by a neophyte.

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:20.830
See you.

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:23.290
Again, focus.

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:25.750
Damn it!

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:31.290
Yeah right, obsessing.
And this is the furthest thing from crap.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:32.800
Putting up a bold front.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:36.380
Hey!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:39.510
What the hell are you doing?

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:40.970
Is it true you broke up?

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:43.720
You're the one who said
you wouldn't let him go.

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:48.230
No response?

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:51.060
If you broke up, it's better for me.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:55.990
Then I can take Mr. Saijo
without having to hold ba—

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:58.610
The car's here, Jun!

00:18:59.070 --> 00:19:00.530
Coming.

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:04.790
Oh. Weren't you having a conversation?

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:07.330
No, it's nothing important.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:08.160
Hey!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:11.080
Yurie, did you change your perfume?

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.880
Oh, you noticed?

00:19:14.340 --> 00:19:15.550
Mr. Ayagi!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:17.670
What did you mean by "take"?

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:19.180
Hey, brat.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:22.010
What's their relationship?

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:25.350
You mean Junta and Yurie?

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:26.350
Yeah.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:29.890
They've been close recently.

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.310
I'm a little jealous.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:35.520
What the hell is he thinking?

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:44.280
You haven't contacted me, so I thought maybe
that promise was voided, Mr. Hasegawa.

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:47.120
Yeah. Sorry to break the news.

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.750
Today's "Tobun." Something's in here?

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.540
YURIE'S BOYS #14
IS SEXIEST MAN OF THE YEAR

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.540
This...

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.670
I took the photo.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:00.010
Or to be more accurate,
the opportunity was given to me.

00:20:00.010 --> 00:20:05.300
Junta Azumaya himself hinted that
he was in a relationship with Yurie Kurokawa.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.680
How could this happen?

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:11.730
He said it would cause trouble
if a photo of him with his ex were published.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:15.020
You two broke up, huh?

00:20:17.070 --> 00:20:19.570
Well, it is what it is.

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:25.200
Unfortunately, the story about you and your
former boyfriend is past its expiration date.

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:27.280
That's better for you, right?

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:32.080
You don't have to sell your body
for a guy who replaced you overnight.

00:20:35.880 --> 00:20:36.960
That idiot!

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.590
What the hell is he doing?!

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:43.130
Letting himself become a gossip item
with "Tobun" regular Yurie Kurokawa!

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.130
YURIE'S BOYS #14
IS SEXIEST MAN OF THE YEAR

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.010
Whatever!

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:47.470
That moron! Stupid angel!

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:50.350
Idiot! Idiot.

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:53.060
But I'm an idiot, too.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:21:00.610
<i>Even though I'm the one who broke up
with him, I didn't think he'd date someone else.</i>

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:05.410
<i>I'm embarrassed at my own arrogance
and the fact that I'm hurt.</i>

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.820
I'm cold.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:12.410
<i>Even though he isn't here,
it seems like his scent has sunk in.</i>

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.080
<i>And the hand he touched me with.</i>

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.460
<i>His whispering voice, too.</i>

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:20.500
<i>Takato, show me your face.</i>

00:21:21.010 --> 00:21:22.380
<i>I remember.</i>

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:25.430
<i>That's how much he's been in this room...</i>

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.350
<i>how much we've made love in this bed...</i>

00:21:29.310 --> 00:21:30.220
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:21:30.720 --> 00:21:33.520
<i>I'm desperately following his traces.</i>

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:36.060
<i>I'm thinking things I shouldn't be thinking.</i>

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:39.190
<i>I want him to touch me again.</i>

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:43.440
<i>His hands are so much bigger than mine</i>

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:45.240
<i>and harder.</i>

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:47.070
<i>More...</i>

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:50.830
I'm such a fool.

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:54.750
<i>His hands will never touch me again.</i>

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:27.340
Wh-What?

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:30.930
- I did it!
- Did what?!

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:33.140
I had it engraved.

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:36.100
What does it say?

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:38.680
hug 12
"mi tesoro."

00:23:38.680 --> 00:23:40.020
The meaning is a secret.
